    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Peacekeeper Corps</strong></p><p><strong>“Order is a gift. Stop making us wrap it in barbed wire.”</strong></p><p>Peacekeepers are what you call them when you want them to sound noble. They build ceasefires, enforce boundaries, and take the blame when someone decides ‘peace’ was optional.</p><p><em>You’ve become legend. Not the comforting kind.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Controlled Hexes are highly stable. The OP cost to prevent rebellion in Triumphant Hexes is reduced by 2, and it is easier to shift Hexes towards Gevurah (Severity/Order).</li></ul>",
